		{
			dependencies: ["00E21B5F73B637C9"]
			description: [
				"Create has no power cables and no magic boxes. It has &erotation&f: something turns, and shafts, cogs and belts carry that turning to machines."
				""
				"Two numbers matter. &eSpeed&f is how fast it turns. &eStress&f is how much the source can carry before everything stops."
				""
				"Hold &eW&f while hovering any Create item (Ponder) to watch it being built and used. It is the best manual in the game."
